    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `security_client.py` file, I need to write code that sets up a client for interacting with a key management and encryption service. I will use AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the concrete third-party managed service for this task. The code will include the necessary imports and functions to configure and use the AWS KMS client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887158405,
          "start": 1789887156050
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bd968f520016IgtucX8048V13",
